  "question": {
    "text": "The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;for which <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mn>49</mn><mn>40</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math>, is equal to _____.&nbsp;",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mn>49</mn><mn>40</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> By Using partial fraction</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>49</mn><mn>40</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>49</mn><mn>40</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mn>49</mn><mn>40</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>49</mn><mn>40</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>49</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Comparing by hit and trial and taking&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>49</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Now putting&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;in equation (i) to corsscheck,</p><p>we&nbsp;get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>49</mn><mn>50</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;which is true&nbsp;</p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp; is correct option,</p><p>Hence&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p>",
